      "evidence": "presign catches every RuntimeException, logs it, and returns null; the Examiner UI renders the null audio URL as ordinary playback-unavailable state and provides no retry for the failed signing operation.",
      "why_it_matters": "A temporary media lookup/signing failure is indistinguishable from absent media, leaving the Examiner unable to hear a response without a visible recovery path.",
      "required_action": "Keep absent media references explicit, but allow signing failures to fail the detail request so the UI's retryable detail-error state can recover.",
      "owner": "cook"
